<title>UK: BayernHypo sets C$100 mln bond due December 2001. [CORRECTED 13:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>BayernHypo sets C$100 mln bond due December 2001. [CORRECTED 13:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager TD Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    31.DEC.01</p>
<p>(Corrects MATURITY from 01.DEC.01 to 31.DEC.01)</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.42   PAY DATE    02.SEP.97</p>
<p>(Corrects ISS PRICE from 100.445 to 100.42)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.02     SPREAD	+11 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/GB/CA/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>(Corrects MGT/UND from 0.20 to 0.225. Corrects SELL CONC from 1.425 to 1.40)</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.00 PCT CANADIAN GOVT BOND DUE SEP.01</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
